== Relationship Between Models and Races ==

In EverQuest player races can appear with different appearances (faces/gear), in any zone.  Monster races that appeared in multiple zones could only have a single model though, because all such models had to fit inside a "global" monster model file.  There were different models for some monsters, but those models were limited to specific zones.

All of the numbered races below were in the global file.  A user with sufficient privileges on an emulated server can spawn an NPC with that model (anywhere) by using it's number.  Races without a number (eg. [[Clockwork Rat]]) are only found in specific zones.

